  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_OMEGA has the value 32</p>
  <p>Used to make the object spin at the specified axis and rate, or retrieve spin settings. See <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlTargetOmega" target="_blank">llTargetOmega</a> for specification.</p>
</p>
    </div>

